/ 025	EMcD	27-Sep-85	Add Dutch and Spanish Xlations (conditionalised)
/ 024	EMcD	14-Sep-85	Add Nordic Translations (conditionalised)
/ 023	EMcD	03-Sep-85	Fix bug induced by moving stuff in panel 
