/ This memory reference map was added for the convenience of future	/a0013
/ developers requiring an overall view of system resource referencing	/a0013

/ FIELD 3	0000-5377	open
/		5400-6377	Merge 'INBLOCK'
/		6400-6777	Merge 'OUTBLOCK'
/		7000-7377	Random Read II 'READ DATA BUFFER'
/		7400-7777	Random Read II 'HEADER BLOCK BUFFER'
/
/ FIELD 4	0000-3427	'XXSDFNBUFFER'
/		3430-3577	open
/		3600-4027	'FNBUFFER'
/		4030-5777	open
/		6000-7777	'SCROLL's BUFFERS
